  "clips_about": "stay: the hips are held over one spot. airborne: a body in the air is brought down to stand on the ground. lift: a body pushed into the ground is lifted out. hands_on_ground: these arms are raised until their hands are not below the ground. parts: two pieces of the clip joined together. made: the clip is made by tools/prepare-rigged.py itself (Meshy has no fishing): keys are moments in the clip (at: a share of it, 0 to 1) saying where the hands are, how far the hips have moved, how many degrees the back leans back (lean), the head tips back (nod) and the shoulders rise (shrug); crank winds one hand round a small circle; strain is a pull that comes and goes on top.",
